              that has the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/right+lifting+property"} right lifting property
              with respect to all inclusions of the form
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
